{"text": "The next morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The little boy put the soldier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the windowsill. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly the window flew open. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the soldier fell. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From the third floor. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nobody knows. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If it was the wind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Or the goblin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The maid and the little boy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Went down. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To look for him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He did not shout. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because he was a soldier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In uniform. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then it began to rain. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Harder and harder. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After the rain. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Two street boys. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Found the soldier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They made a boat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Out of newspaper. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And put him in it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The boat floated down the gutter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And into a long, dark tunnel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A big water rat jumped out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And shouted. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Show me your passport. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the soldier said nothing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And held his gun more tightly.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "n", "e", "x", "t", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "b", "o", "y", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "o", "l", "d", "i", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "O", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", "o", "w", "s", "i", "l", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", 